<section class="section-gap">
  <div class="container-main">
    <div class="faq-layout">
      <div class="section-header is-centered">
        <div reveal-anim-1="" class="section-eyebrow center">
          <div class="section-eyebrow-dot"></div>
          <div>FAQ</div>
        </div>
        <h2 section-title="" class="heading-style-2 section-title is-centered is-wide">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-body">
        <div reveal-anim-2="" class="filter-row">
          <a aria-pressed="true" href="#" data-filter="Automation" role="button" class="filter-pill is-active">Automation</a>
          <a aria-pressed="false" href="#" data-filter="Feedback" role="button" class="filter-pill">Feedback</a>
          <a aria-pressed="false" href="#" data-filter="SaaS" role="button" class="filter-pill">SaaS</a>
        </div>
        <div data-category="Automation" faq-list="" data-faq-open="first" class="faq-list">
          <div reveal-anim-1="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question is-bold">Which industries benefit most from Euphoria’s automation?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Euphoria is built for finance-led teams in SaaS, fintech, agencies and e-commerce. Any business that reconciles bank feeds, sends invoices and reports to investors will see the biggest gains in the first month.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-2="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question is-bold">What is the usual process to get started?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Connect your bank accounts and accounting tool, invite your team, and Euphoria imports the last 12 months of transactions. Most teams are fully set up in under an hour with guided onboarding.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-3="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question is-bold">How long does a typical implementation take?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Self-serve plans go live the same day. Business and partnership customers usually complete a full rollout, including historical data migration and custom reports, within two to three weeks.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-4="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question is-bold">Do you support companies operating in multiple countries?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. Euphoria handles multi-currency ledgers, entity-level reporting and consolidated statements, so a group with subsidiaries in several countries can close every entity from one workspace.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-5="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question is-bold">Can Euphoria integrate with our existing business systems?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Native integrations cover the most common accounting, payment, payroll and CRM tools, and an open API lets your engineers connect anything else. See the Integrations page for the full list.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div reveal-anim-6="" class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <div class="faq-question is-bold">What kind of customer support do you offer after launch?</div>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Every plan includes email support and a searchable help centre. Business customers get priority chat and a shared Slack channel with a dedicated finance specialist who knows your setup.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-category="Feedback" faq-list="" class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">How do I share feedback about Euphoria?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Use the feedback button inside the app or reply to any product email. Every message reaches our product team directly, and you can attach screenshots so we understand exactly what you need.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">How quickly does the team respond to feedback?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">We reply to every piece of feedback within one business day. Bug reports are triaged the same day, and you receive an update by email as soon as a fix or improvement ships.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">Can I request a new feature or integration?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. Submit a request from the app and other customers can vote on it. The most requested features and integrations are reviewed every month and added to the roadmap.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">Do you share a public product roadmap?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Our roadmap is visible to every customer inside the app. You can see what is planned, what is in progress and what has shipped, along with the feedback that shaped each item.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">How do you collect feedback from finance teams?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Besides in-app feedback, we run short quarterly interviews with controllers and CFOs, and every new release is tested with a small group of customers before it reaches everyone.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">What happens after I report a bug?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">A support engineer confirms the issue, shares a workaround if one exists and tracks the fix. Critical issues affecting your books are prioritised and usually resolved within hours.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-category="SaaS" faq-list="" class="faq-list">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">Is Euphoria built for SaaS companies?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. Euphoria was designed with subscription businesses in mind, from seed-stage startups to scale-ups with multiple entities, recurring billing and investor reporting needs.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">Does Euphoria handle subscription revenue recognition?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Annual and multi-month plans are spread across the service period automatically. Deferred revenue schedules update whenever a customer upgrades, downgrades or cancels mid-term.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">Can I track MRR, ARR and churn?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Live dashboards show MRR, ARR, net revenue retention and churn, all calculated from reconciled billing data so the numbers always match your ledger and board reports.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">Does it connect to my billing platform?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Euphoria connects to the most popular payment and billing tools in a few clicks. Invoices, payouts and fees sync automatically and reconcile against your bank feeds every day.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">How does Euphoria handle usage-based pricing?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Metered and hybrid plans are supported. Usage charges are matched to the right customer and period, so revenue, margins and forecasts stay accurate as consumption changes.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item">
            <div class="faq-toggle">
              <p class="faq-question is-bold">Can I share SaaS metrics with investors?</p>
              <div class="faq-icon is-filled">
                <div class="faq-icon-bar"></div>
                <div class="faq-icon-bar is-vertical"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p class="faq-answer-text">Yes. Build an investor update once and Euphoria refreshes it every month with live revenue, burn and runway. Share it as a secure link or export it to PDF in one click.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
